mode: "100644"
text: "# The INDEX framework — YouTube publish metadata that ranks\n\nMetadata is the **index card the algorithm reads first** — it's the launchpad before user behavior kicks\nin. INDEX writes the title/description/tags and sets category/privacy/madeForKids. The **video FILE +\nscript are inputs**; **WoopSocial publishes via the YouTube fields**; the **thumbnail + A/B testing are\nnative Studio**.\n\n## I — Intent-match the title\n- **Primary keyword in the first ~40 chars**, ~**50–60** total. **Two jobs:** rank (keyword) + click\n  (clarity/curiosity). Power words help; **autocomplete/long-tail**; **clarity over cleverness.**\n\n## N — Nail the description above-the-fold\n- **Line 1 = value/hook**; **primary keyword in lines 2–3**; **300–500 words** natural (no stuffing).\n  **Keyword-named chapters/timestamps**; **3–7 links** (internal first); **affiliate disclosure** if any.\n  (The description is `content.text`.)\n\n## D — Direct the tags\n- **First tag = exact primary keyword**; then secondary + niche. **Relevant-only** (YouTube's AI checks);\n  tags are a minor signal now, so don't over-invest — get the first one right.\n\n## E — Elect category + privacy\n- Pick the **accurate `category`** (correct grouping/recommendation). Set **`privacy`** (`public` for\n  reach / `unlisted` link-only / `private`) to the goal.\n\n## X — eXamine the kids-flag + validate\n- Set **`madeForKids` truthfully** per **COPPA/FTC** (child-directed content → made-for-kids; it disables\n  comments/personalized ads/etc.). **Never mislabel.** Then **validate** (`YOUTUBE_PRIVACY/CATEGORY/TAGS`,\n  TITLE, DESCRIPTION) before publish. **No update** → delete+recreate (or edit in Studio post-publish).\n\n## The metadata brief a request should fill\n```\nINPUTS: the video file + script (external); brand-profile voice; the goal (search reach / subs / watch time)\nTITLE: primary keyword in first ~40 chars; ~50-60 total; rank + click; power word; clarity\nDESCRIPTION (content.text): line 1 value -> keyword lines 2-3 -> 300-500 words; chapters; 3-7 links + disclosure\nTAGS: first = exact primary keyword; secondary + niche; relevant-only\nCATEGORY + PRIVACY: accurate category; public/unlisted/private per goal\nKIDS + CHECK: madeForKids set truthfully (COPPA); validate; thumbnail + A/B = native Studio; metrics native (never fabricated)\n```\n"
